WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:04.576
A new web-course demonstration for teachers. This is not Canvas.

2
00:00:04.576 --> 00:00:09.125
Module 1 pairs a score-distribution graphic with the full data table.

3
00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:13.692
Each option receives explanatory feedback. Incorrect reasoning can be revised.

4
00:00:13.692 --> 00:00:18.241
Module 2 distinguishes accuracy among respondents from missing evidence.

5
00:00:18.241 --> 00:00:22.772
Module 3 connects tentative interpretation to a targeted action and fresh check.

6
00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:27.307
The final decision brief uses a transparent self-review rubric, not AI scoring.

7
00:00:27.307 --> 00:00:31.840
Learners can compare a model response, download their brief, or print the packet.
